  "description": "<html> <head> <meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\"> <meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Word 15 (filtered)\"> <style> <!-- /* Font Definitions */ @font-face {font-family:Wingdings; panose-1:5 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0;} @font-face {font-family:Mangal; panose-1:0 0 4 0 0 0 0 0 0 0;} @font-face {font-family:\"Cambria Math\"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:Calibri; panose-1:2 15 5 2 2 2 4 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:\"Book Antiqua\"; panose-1:2 4 6 2 5 3 5 3 3 4;} @font-face {font-family:\"Sitka Small\"; panose-1:2 0 5 5 0 0 0 2 0 4;} @font-face {font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\"; panose-1:2 11 5 2 4 2 4 2 2 3;} @font-face {font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\"; panose-1:2 5 6 4 5 5 5 2 2 4;} /* Style Definitions */ p.MsoNoSpacing, li.MsoNoSpacing, div.MsoNoSpacing {margin:0cm; font-size:11.0pt; font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif;} .MsoPapDefault {margin-bottom:8.0pt; line-height:107%;} @page WordSection1 {size:612.0pt 792.0pt; margin:72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt 36.0pt; border:solid #806000 1.0pt; padding:24.0pt 24.0pt 24.0pt 24.0pt;} div.WordSection1 {page:WordSection1;} /* List Definitions */ ol {margin-bottom:0cm;} ul {margin-bottom:0cm;} --> </style> </head> <body bgcolor=\"#FBE4D5\" lang=EN-IN style='word-wrap:break-word'> <div class=WordSection1> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif;color:#002060'>GYAN BOOKS</span></b></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family: \"Book Antiqua\",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>INTRODUCING A REMARKABLE LEATHER-BOUND EDITION, METICULOUSLY CRAFTED BY THE ESTEEMED INSTITUTION</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif;color:#C00000'>&quot;</span></b><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:22.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif;color:#C00000'>RARE BIBLIO&quot;.</span></b></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family: \"Book Antiqua\",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Sitka Small\";color:black'>This title holds the distinction of being a Bestseller, highly praised by readers across the GLOBE. </span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Sitka Small\";color:black'>We are thrilled to present this literary gem exclusively to our elite readers, meticulously encased in our one-of-a-kind </span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><b><i><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Sitka Small\";color:black'>Premium Leather Binding</span></i></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt; font-family:\"Sitka Small\";color:black'>. Following your order, we purchase the book from the original publisher/distributor and embark on the</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Sitka Small\";color:black'> process of rebinding to elevate this book to a Luxurious Reading Style.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family: \"Book Antiqua\",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>A UNIQUE LEATHER-BOUND BOOK FOR ELITE READERS/COLLECTORS OF OLD RARE AND BESTSELLING BOOKS. </span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><b><i><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Sitka Small\";color:#806000'>For the Binding, we use </span></i></b><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size: 16.0pt;font-family:\"Sitka Small\";color:#806000'>GENUINE<i> LEATHER</i></span></u></b><b><i><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Sitka Small\";color:#806000'>, graced with opulent <u>GOLDEN LEAF DETAILING</u> on the <u>SPINE</u>, <u>FRONT COVER</u>, AND <u>BACK COVER</u>, ADDED BY <u>EDGE GILDING</u>.</span></i></b></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family: \"Book Antiqua\",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif;color:#002060'>ABOUT US</span></b></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family: \"Book Antiqua\",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;    </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>We deal into reprinting of the master pieces crafted by authors around the world.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:72.0pt;text-indent:-36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;    </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>We are proud to say that we have a collection of over 25 million books and our collection includes books that are as old as 200 years and hence are considered as RARE BOOKS.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;    </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>We are pioneer in this field having experience of 40 years. </span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;    </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>We also undertake printing and Leather Binding jobs of other books.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;    </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>Thesis printing and Leather Binding is one of our important Service</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;    </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>Many publishers and author approach us for their books to bind in our Unique leather binding format for their special customers.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;    </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>Our craftsmen are active in this job since generations.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;    </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>Restoration of old books is our expertise</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;    </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>We are known by our Customization options.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;    </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>We have many leather color options in our bucket.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;    </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>The whole process is done manually so that it gives you the same feeling of old book.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif;color:#002060'>OFFERS &amp; SPECIALIZATION:</span></b></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family: \"Book Antiqua\",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:18.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent: 18.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;<b><i><span style='color:#806000'>    </span></i></b></span><b><i><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;color:#806000'>SPECIAL DISCOUNT FOR BULK ORDERS, PLEASE CONTACT US.</span></i></b></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:72.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent: -36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;</span><b><i><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif; color:#806000'>    </span></i></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt; font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>CHOOSE ANY LEATHER COLOR OF YOUR CHOICE WITHOUT ANY EXTRA CHARGES, JUST CLICK ON IMAGES FOR OPTIONAL COLORS AND INFORM     US YOUR CHOICE THROUGH MAIL WITH COLOR CODE. </span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:72.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent: -36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;</span><b><i><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif; color:#806000'>    </span></i></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt; font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>WE OFFER A DIVERSE RANGE OF LEATHER COLORS, INCLUDING <b><span style='color:#CC0000'>RED</span></b>, <b><span style='color:#538135'>GREEN</span></b>, <b><span style='color:#1F4E79'>BLUE</span></b>, BLACK, <b><span style='color:#D60093'>MAGENTA</span></b>, <b><span style='color:#BF8F00'>YELLOW</span></b>, <b><span style='color:#AE6C52'>TAN</span></b>. WE ALSO OFFER MULTI-COLOR LABELS WITH THESE BEAUTIFUL BOOKS ON SPECIAL REQUEST.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:72.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent: -36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;<b><i><span style='color:#806000'>    </span></i></b></span><b><i><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>AN ORIGINAL LEATHER IS BEING USED FOR BINDING THIS BOOK WITH GOLDEN LEAF PRINTING AND DESIGNING ON SPINE, FRONT AND BACK OF THE BOOK WITH EDGE GILDING</span></i></b><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>.</span></b></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif;color:#002060'>Points to note before booking order:</span></b></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:72.0pt;text-indent:-36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;     </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>In case of multi volume sets, please note that the above listing is for a single volume only. (To order multiple volumes, please contact us separately).</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:72.0pt;text-indent:-36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;     </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>We urge you to appreciate that our Leather-Bound Books are Genuine works of art and are Handcrafted by our Professional Craftsmen. Thus, requiring time and care to reach the pinnacle of excellence.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:18.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;     </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>We Prepare the Book after receiving the Order.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:72.0pt;text-indent:-36.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;     </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>We request you to understand that these leather-bound books are work of art and hence require time to go through different process to be the master pieces that they are.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:18.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;     </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>We usually take 40 business days as handling time to dispatch shipment. We consider special request for a special occasion.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:18.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;     </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>Craftsman based in India, prepared this book and shipped from different stock locations around the Globe.</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family: \"Book Antiqua\",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif;color:#002060'>Product Details: -</span></b></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:18.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;     </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>Complete Title:  Too Many Losing Heroines! (Light Novel) Vol. 5 By Amamori, Takibi Imigimuru [Premium Leather Bound] </span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:18.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;     </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>Author:  Amamori, Takibi Imigimuru  </span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:18.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;     </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>Language:  ENGLISH </span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:18.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;     </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>No. Of Pages:  240 </span></p> <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:18.0pt'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\"Segoe UI Symbol\",sans-serif'>&#9733;     </span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:\"Book Antiqua\",serif'>Year:  2025 </span></p> <p 